    {
      "zh": "有的人去别的国家读书。",
      "en": "Some went to other countries to study."
    },
    {
      "zh": "他们看到了很多新东西。",
      "en": "They saw many new things."
    },
    {
      "zh": "学好了以后，很多人回来了。",
      "en": "After finishing, many of them came back."
    },
    {
      "zh": "他们做老师，做医生，也做事。",
      "en": "They became teachers, doctors, and workers."
    },
    {
      "zh": "他们写新的书，也说新的话。",
      "en": "They wrote new books and spoke in new ways."
    },
    {
      "zh": "他们想让国家好起来。",
      "en": "They wanted to make the country better."
    },
    {
      "zh": "他们说，读书可以改变国家。",
      "en": "They said that study can change a country."
